WEBVTT

00:14.774 --> 00:17.944
Meeting someone is surely

00:17.944 --> 00:21.114
The dawn within our hearts

00:21.114 --> 00:27.454
And a new breeze is born from there

00:27.454 --> 00:33.894
Once you've realized you're not alone

00:33.894 --> 00:40.404
The translucent Moon will smile

00:40.404 --> 00:46.774
Then, the prelude you can hear in your spirit

00:46.774 --> 00:52.944
Is a nostalgic but unusual song

00:52.944 --> 00:56.154
We are not alone

00:56.154 --> 00:59.324
Surely

00:59.324 --> 01:07.494
Everyone is born so that they can meet someone

01:07.494 --> 01:15.174
Ah, out into the boundless world...

01:15.174 --> 01:23.474
Yes, so we may search for love

01:37.164 --> 01:38.794
Feena...

01:38.794 --> 01:40.854
Such a lovely face with which you smile.

01:45.534 --> 01:47.104
Excellency.

01:47.104 --> 01:49.974
We've received Miss Feena's
scheduled transmission.

01:50.544 --> 01:51.664
Put it through.

01:52.844 --> 01:55.144
You look well, Feena.

01:55.144 --> 01:58.284
I'm glad to see you in good health also, Father.

01:58.284 --> 02:00.714
No problems with your stay on Earth?

02:00.854 --> 02:03.814
No, sir. Earth has been most kind to me.

02:03.984 --> 02:09.724
I see. But you also have your duties.
Do not overextend yourself.

02:09.724 --> 02:13.264
Thank you, but the people here
have been quite helpful.

02:13.264 --> 02:16.164
Ah, I also have a message from the President.

02:16.394 --> 02:18.334
She asks that perhaps while
enjoying a cup of tea,

02:18.334 --> 02:22.864
you might sometimes meet to exchange
memories of Sefiria, my mother.

02:23.304 --> 02:25.204
That sounds like something she'd say.

02:25.204 --> 02:30.004
In any case, the station proposal
was your mother's earnest desire...

02:30.184 --> 02:32.714
Her desire has yet to be realized.

02:32.714 --> 02:38.444
There is no rush. That will be the work
of the next queen. And her king.

02:39.884 --> 02:44.514
For that reason, we must proceed with
marriage talks with the House of Kruger.

02:44.724 --> 02:49.494
Please wait! I believe I voiced my refusal
regarding this before I departed!

02:50.064 --> 02:52.364
What troubles you?

02:52.364 --> 02:56.674
He is the ideal man,
of a noble and wealthy family.

02:56.674 --> 02:58.044
But he is...

02:58.044 --> 02:59.574
You need not say it.

02:59.574 --> 03:04.704
Politics is more than just conciliation.
It requires a special set of values.

03:05.484 --> 03:06.744
Do you understand?

03:07.514 --> 03:11.854
With your permission, I shall now conclude
today's transmission. Farewell.

03:22.064 --> 03:24.034
Such a troublesome matter...

03:24.264 --> 03:25.764
- Episode 7-
The Princess's Fiancé!

03:25.764 --> 03:28.004
- Episode 7-
The Princess's Fiancé!
The Princess's Fiancé!

03:28.004 --> 03:30.234
- Episode 7-
The Princess's Fiancé!

03:44.624 --> 03:46.354
Mia, pass the soy sauce.

03:46.354 --> 03:47.784
Ma'am!

03:48.894 --> 03:50.014
Thank you.

03:54.734 --> 03:56.224
The food was delicious.

03:57.164 --> 03:59.864
I've already informed Sayaka...

03:59.864 --> 04:03.824
but beginning tomorrow I shall be
working at the embassy.

04:04.074 --> 04:06.914
For the time being, I shall not
be attending school.

04:06.914 --> 04:08.374
What?!

04:08.374 --> 04:13.284
Feena, you're leaving?! Has something
about our house dissatisfied you?

04:13.284 --> 04:14.874
That's not it!

04:15.284 --> 04:18.424
Miss Feena has gotten
a little busy with her duties,

04:18.424 --> 04:21.514
so it's easier if she just stays at the embassy.

04:22.794 --> 04:26.724
I'll be coming back.
Leave my room as it is, okay?

04:26.934 --> 04:29.424
Oh! I'm so glad!

04:32.534 --> 04:36.974
Mia, prepare my things.
Just the bare essentials will be fine.

04:37.344 --> 04:41.214
Yes, ma'am. Um, and I?

04:41.214 --> 04:43.344
You stay here.

04:43.344 --> 04:47.804
If you began cleaning up the embassy,
it would put the staff in a bit of a dilemma.

04:47.984 --> 04:50.454
Honestly, Princess!

04:53.754 --> 04:56.194
Here. You can't forget this, can you?

04:57.864 --> 05:00.594
That is not necessary.

05:00.894 --> 05:03.164
Y-yes, ma'am.

05:03.564 --> 05:07.554
But it'll be so lonely without you, Feena!

05:07.734 --> 05:11.404
Mai! It's for her job. Don't be selfish.

05:12.174 --> 05:14.344
Okay, fine.

05:14.344 --> 05:20.474
Also, Feena will one day be going back
to the Moon. She's a princess!

05:24.324 --> 05:25.654
Good morning!

05:25.654 --> 05:27.294
Good morning, Brother!

05:27.294 --> 05:28.514
Good morning.

05:28.854 --> 05:33.524
It looks like Sis and Feena left
before we woke up.

05:33.524 --> 05:36.894
The two of you need to eat quickly
or you'll be late.

05:48.574 --> 05:50.544
This is most unusual.

05:50.544 --> 05:50.714
REPORTS
DUE
This is most unusual.

05:50.714 --> 05:52.344
REPORTS
DUE
I'm sorry.

05:52.344 --> 05:56.284
REPORTS
DUE
Well, not to worry. Come on, let's start class.

05:56.284 --> 05:56.784
REPORTS
DUE
Yes, sir.

05:56.784 --> 05:56.854
Yes, sir.

05:56.854 --> 05:58.484
Did something happen?

05:58.484 --> 06:02.654
Asagiri of all people, forgetting his
Intro to Lunar Studies report!

06:02.754 --> 06:04.694
I-I don't know...

06:10.094 --> 06:13.774
Does this maybe have something to do
with Feena being on vacation?!

06:13.774 --> 06:17.444
Stop making your eyes sparkle with curiosity!

06:17.444 --> 06:20.104
Toyama! Read page 85!

06:20.104 --> 06:22.144
I forgot my textbook!

06:22.144 --> 06:23.644
Go stand in the hallway.

06:23.644 --> 06:25.084
Yes, sir!

06:25.084 --> 06:26.874
Don't go so happily!

06:30.254 --> 06:32.654
I'm sorry about today, sir.

06:33.084 --> 06:34.724
Get plenty of rest tonight!

06:34.724 --> 06:35.694
All right.

06:35.694 --> 06:37.154
Good night!

06:39.394 --> 06:43.264
My word! What was wrong with Tatsuya today?

06:43.494 --> 06:45.764
He got customers' orders all wrong...

06:46.034 --> 06:48.264
Spectacularly broke the plates...

06:48.404 --> 06:51.064
It's like his mind was somewhere else.

06:51.444 --> 06:53.674
Just leave him be for now.

06:54.014 --> 06:59.444
The only thing we can do to help is pay for
today's damages out of your salary.

06:59.444 --> 07:02.414
Why must it be so, Father?!

07:02.854 --> 07:06.784
Why? Why?! Answer me pweease!

07:10.824 --> 07:13.664
This will do, Wreathlit.

07:14.894 --> 07:19.924
So long as they exercise self-restraint,
we can remain in the shadows.

07:28.144 --> 07:29.404
Thank you, Tatsuya.

07:30.814 --> 07:32.304
Thank you, Karen.

07:32.814 --> 07:37.254
It seems Tatsuya provided you
with considerable support.

07:37.684 --> 07:39.054
Yes...

07:39.554 --> 07:42.524
He generally appears to be
simply staring into space

07:42.524 --> 07:45.514
but when needed, he is always by your side.

07:46.524 --> 07:48.524
That's the kind of person he is.

07:49.234 --> 07:51.824
It is not my place to speak, but...

07:52.564 --> 07:55.304
Would you not be able to perform your duties
at the Asagiri household?

07:55.304 --> 07:57.174
That would not do!

07:57.174 --> 08:02.444
I've taken the best course of action
to fulfill my duties as princess.

08:09.754 --> 08:14.584
Unbelievable! Even her clumsiness
in times of stress is just like Sefiria!

08:17.094 --> 08:19.154
Boss!

08:22.034 --> 08:25.234
Feel shame at your inexperience having given
your subjects cause for concern.

08:25.234 --> 08:29.764
Guiding one's people toward a prosperous future
is the nobility's true calling.

08:29.834 --> 08:32.304
Rid your mind of trivial matters...

08:32.774 --> 08:35.574
Feena Fam Earthlight.

08:56.134 --> 08:57.234
Shut up!

08:57.234 --> 08:58.994
Yes, with pleasure!

09:00.364 --> 09:02.704
All right, that's enough work.

09:02.704 --> 09:05.974
Now then, what shall we talk about today?

09:06.104 --> 09:07.244
Well...

09:07.244 --> 09:11.744
I would definitely like to hear about my mother's
specialty, slipping past her security detail.

09:11.744 --> 09:12.834
Well, now...

09:18.154 --> 09:19.124
Here.

09:20.924 --> 09:22.354
Thank you.

09:22.794 --> 09:25.784
I feel badly for Tatsuya about this.

09:26.664 --> 09:28.854
But we're not mistaken.

09:30.464 --> 09:33.264
As a public official, I believe
it's the right choice...

09:33.804 --> 09:37.964
But I think I'm a washout as a big sister.

09:40.614 --> 09:45.514
By the way, we haven't seen Feena
for almost a week, have we?

09:46.344 --> 09:48.474
I'm sure she's busy with work.

09:48.914 --> 09:50.884
You're taking this better than I imagined.

09:50.884 --> 09:53.544
It's no big deal, right?

09:54.094 --> 09:55.994
Okay, if that's how you feel...

10:02.764 --> 10:03.994
Feena!

10:04.264 --> 10:05.594
Tatsuya...

10:13.174 --> 10:17.004
"No big deal." I really thought that, but...

10:17.114 --> 10:22.774
I don't know why, but just looking
at each other like this, I feel so...

10:23.714 --> 10:25.984
What brings you here today?

10:26.424 --> 10:28.754
I came to get a change of clothes.

10:34.334 --> 10:36.824
I feel so... happy.
I feel so... happy.

10:36.934 --> 10:40.134
Honestly, these two...

10:40.874 --> 10:43.634
Well, I won't bother you guys anymore.

10:43.904 --> 10:45.434
Natsuki!

10:51.414 --> 10:52.414
We're home.

10:52.414 --> 10:55.114
It looks like my brother's back!

10:55.384 --> 10:57.244
And Miss Feena as well!

11:03.194 --> 11:04.554
A visitor?

11:05.364 --> 11:07.624
These boots are Royal Military-issue.

11:07.994 --> 11:10.054
Miss Feena!

11:11.264 --> 11:13.364
How I longed to see you!

11:13.364 --> 11:15.234
I'm sorry Mia.

11:28.954 --> 11:31.524
It has been too long, my Princess.

11:31.524 --> 11:35.614
I, Jurgen, come on behalf
of the House of Kruger.

11:37.594 --> 11:38.994
Um...

11:39.564 --> 11:41.324
I've brought some tea.

11:46.104 --> 11:48.074
I-I'm sorry!

11:49.904 --> 11:54.504
Insolent curs! Boil them alive in tea!

11:57.884 --> 12:00.904
At least use a high-quality tea!

12:03.084 --> 12:03.984
Miss?

12:06.084 --> 12:09.644
Are you all right?
Have you sustained any burns?

12:09.854 --> 12:12.964
N-no!

12:12.964 --> 12:14.584
Oh, that's right...

12:19.904 --> 12:21.674
Pay it no mind.

12:21.674 --> 12:23.634
I'm sorry.

12:24.874 --> 12:26.364
Sir Jurgen...

12:27.044 --> 12:31.074
As captain of my father's personal guard,
what is it that brings you here?

12:32.144 --> 12:35.414
To deliver a letter, as
His Majesty's representative.

12:35.414 --> 12:38.384
My apologies for the inconvenience...

12:38.384 --> 12:41.654
but I am here to observe
the lifestyle of my future bride.

12:42.724 --> 12:44.524
Future bride?!

12:45.564 --> 12:46.994
Feena...

12:49.464 --> 12:53.804
If aware of your rudeness,
should you not have shown restraint?

12:53.804 --> 12:57.864
And had I sought your permission to visit,
would it have been granted?

13:00.004 --> 13:04.944
You would appear ill at ease.
I shall take my leave of you now.

13:05.384 --> 13:10.544
I am at the embassy for the moment,
so let us continue this conversation later.

13:11.424 --> 13:13.754
Tatsuya Asagiri, was it?

13:16.094 --> 13:21.324
It would appear you have been of
assistance to my fiancée. I thank you.

13:21.594 --> 13:24.084
Uh, not at all.

13:28.334 --> 13:30.164
Until later, Princess.

13:33.874 --> 13:36.004
Let me see you out!

13:38.444 --> 13:40.884
You're engaged, huh?

13:41.684 --> 13:45.254
You are a princess, after all,
so it's not so surprising.

13:45.254 --> 13:47.084
Actually, it makes perfect sense.

13:47.954 --> 13:52.794
There was indeed talk of my becoming
engaged to Jurgen von Kruger.

13:53.164 --> 13:56.684
But I refused before leaving the Moon...

13:56.934 --> 14:01.334
And again in my recent
scheduled communication.

14:01.334 --> 14:03.634
Oh, really?

14:07.574 --> 14:09.714
Ready new garments for me.

14:09.714 --> 14:13.374
These have been touched by filthy
Earthling hands, and I cannot stand them!

14:13.814 --> 14:15.244
Yes, sir.

14:15.814 --> 14:18.124
There's nothing at all to this letter, is there?

14:18.124 --> 14:22.324
I believe it was just an excuse, the real goal
being to throw the Earth off track.

14:22.324 --> 14:26.784
Is that man so deep in Lyones' pocket
that he's willing to condone such action?

14:27.124 --> 14:29.794
Or does he have no choice but to condone it?

14:29.964 --> 14:33.564
He is of the House of Kruger, whose power
is second only to the royal family

14:33.564 --> 14:38.004
and who are the greatest faction
of the anti-Earth camp...

14:38.444 --> 14:41.704
To think that he, their eldest son,
is engaged to Princess Feena!

14:51.654 --> 14:54.144
Practicing alone is somewhat lonely, no?

14:55.224 --> 14:57.324
If you like, I could join you...

14:57.324 --> 14:58.554
as your opponent.

15:03.134 --> 15:04.834
Do you not require protective gear?

15:04.834 --> 15:06.364
Begging your pardon,

15:06.364 --> 15:10.604
but if your weapon could strike me, I would be
unfit to be captain of the personal guard.

15:26.354 --> 15:28.554
Very well, attack me however you like.

15:39.904 --> 15:42.494
You are quite powerful. However...

15:47.814 --> 15:50.474
...you are still a woman.

15:55.884 --> 15:58.014
His Excellency is regretful.

15:58.424 --> 16:03.154
He could not protect the late Madam Sefiria,
could not offer himself up to save her.

16:04.594 --> 16:08.724
However, in accordance with His Majesty's
wishes, I shall protect you.

16:09.764 --> 16:15.134
All you must do is give up this fairy tale
of co-existing with the Earth.

16:15.704 --> 16:17.794
For the good of the people!

16:18.074 --> 16:19.504
The good of the people?

16:19.744 --> 16:24.944
Do not forget, this also means you shall
have to abandon that Earth boy.

16:29.554 --> 16:33.414
Now then, I await your return
on the Moon, Princess.

16:33.954 --> 16:37.224
To be honest, this Earth air
does not agree with me.

16:53.974 --> 16:55.104
Dammit!

16:59.284 --> 17:00.504
Natsuki!

17:01.984 --> 17:04.784
What do you want at this hour, Natsuki?

17:04.784 --> 17:07.914
How's Feena? I'm worried about her.

17:08.354 --> 17:10.224
She's back at the embassy.

17:10.224 --> 17:12.594
You let her go back?! Why?

17:12.824 --> 17:16.784
What do you mean, "Why?"
I can't tell her what to do.

17:17.164 --> 17:19.604
Also, I just don't know.

17:20.304 --> 17:21.464
Know what?

17:21.634 --> 17:27.244
I'd wanted to see her for so long...
That's all there was to it.

17:27.244 --> 17:29.874
"For so long"? What does that mean?

17:34.884 --> 17:39.824
I'd never heard that before! So that's why
you've always liked the Moon.

17:40.454 --> 17:44.684
I got to see Feena again, and
I should've been fine with that.

17:45.124 --> 17:48.114
But then I got to know the different sides to her...

17:48.594 --> 17:52.054
I don't really get why, but this hurts.

17:54.164 --> 17:56.834
Tatsuya, you like her.

17:57.974 --> 17:59.374
Once upon a time,

17:59.374 --> 18:04.834
a young boy fell in love at first sight with
a princess who'd come down from the Moon.

18:05.584 --> 18:07.134
That's all there is to it.

18:07.414 --> 18:08.644
I...

18:10.384 --> 18:11.914
I... like Feena.

18:12.454 --> 18:16.484
You couldn't run to her because
you didn't know what you were feeling...

18:16.824 --> 18:21.494
But if you've remembered how
you felt when you first met Feena,

18:21.494 --> 18:22.654
then now you can, right?

18:26.164 --> 18:27.964
Thank you, Natsuki!

18:31.744 --> 18:33.604
Good luck, Tatsuya.

18:36.274 --> 18:39.334
Tatsuya! Where are you going at this hour?

18:39.614 --> 18:41.274
Sis, I'm sorry!

18:42.554 --> 18:44.714
Is this about Feena?

18:45.024 --> 18:48.514
When you talked to me about her, I was scared.

18:48.754 --> 18:51.484
Like you said, she's from a faraway planet...

18:51.894 --> 18:53.794
But it's no good!

18:54.224 --> 18:57.024
Because since long ago, Feena has been my...

18:57.364 --> 18:58.624
Tatsuya.

18:59.534 --> 19:02.804
Miss Feena is lost and suffering right now.

19:03.134 --> 19:08.444
Are you prepared to face her, to support her
no matter what happens?

19:14.244 --> 19:15.774
Sis!

19:17.414 --> 19:19.824
Mr. Tatsuya has gone to see Miss Feena?

19:19.824 --> 19:22.254
Yes. No hesitation whatsoever.

19:23.024 --> 19:25.154
I wonder who he got that from.

19:25.994 --> 19:27.754
Well that's obvious!

19:28.264 --> 19:29.824
Chiharu, right?

19:30.564 --> 19:33.894
It would seem that Sayaka
told you about Sir Jurgen.

19:34.164 --> 19:40.474
He's a top anti-Earth proponent who wants to
flat-out refuse any Lunar-Terran dealings, right?

19:41.244 --> 19:45.514
And yet, he is a prominent figure
within the kingdom.

19:45.514 --> 19:50.154
You are an Earthling, and nothing more
than a student at that.

19:50.154 --> 19:51.914
What could you hope to do?

19:53.224 --> 19:56.154
I don't "hope" to do anything. I WILL do it!

19:57.964 --> 20:02.864
Feena has tried long and hard to one day
become a queen like Lady Sefiria.

20:02.864 --> 20:05.664
I will not forgive anyone
who stands in the way of that!

20:05.864 --> 20:07.974
Simply saying it is easy.

20:07.974 --> 20:13.534
That day when I met Feena,
I'd already made up my mind!

20:14.614 --> 20:18.614
No matter how much it hurt, no matter
if I had to crawl on my hands and knees

20:18.614 --> 20:21.374
I would definitely walk the same road as Feena!

20:25.124 --> 20:26.644
Miss Feena is...

20:38.264 --> 20:40.704
Tatsuya! What are you doing here?

20:41.274 --> 20:43.204
Karen told me where you were.

20:43.204 --> 20:44.574
Karen did?

20:44.774 --> 20:46.004
Feena...

20:48.774 --> 20:55.474
The Moon and the Earth, hand in hand.
I thought that was what the kingdom wanted.

20:55.954 --> 21:02.854
But he has negated my beliefs,
and I was powerless to stop him.

21:03.054 --> 21:06.614
My ideals may become harmful to the kingdom!

21:07.024 --> 21:08.494
So you're just going to give up?

21:09.934 --> 21:15.164
If it is for the kingdom!
If all of the people wish it...

21:15.404 --> 21:17.304
And you're all right with that?

21:17.834 --> 21:19.874
Are you really all right with that, Feena?!

21:19.874 --> 21:22.464
Let go! Let go of me, Tatsuya!

21:23.144 --> 21:24.404
Don't run away from your queen!

21:26.384 --> 21:28.904
I won't let you fight this on your own.

21:29.454 --> 21:34.184
I don't know what battles
or what hardships lie ahead,

21:34.454 --> 21:36.044
but I will face them with you!

21:40.494 --> 21:41.684
Tatsuya...

21:44.464 --> 21:45.434
I...

21:46.334 --> 21:47.524
I...

21:48.234 --> 21:51.174
I... I love you!

22:09.094 --> 22:13.824
That platinum-colored crescent moon

22:13.824 --> 22:21.804
Stands still now, gently

22:21.804 --> 22:29.074
I look up at the sky and think

22:29.074 --> 22:39.554
That falling star is surely the Moon's tears

22:39.554 --> 22:46.994
And I thought of you

22:46.994 --> 22:55.104
Why do I cry these tears?

22:55.104 --> 23:03.014
Though all I am doing is praying for eternity...

23:03.014 --> 23:11.014
I want to walk with you, believing in the future

23:11.014 --> 23:23.264
No matter how many times
the Moon waxes and wanes

23:25.164 --> 23:26.234
Preview

23:26.234 --> 23:28.674
Preview
Two people, each of them nurturing
the emotions of their childhood.

23:28.674 --> 23:29.604
Two people, each of them nurturing
the emotions of their childhood.

23:29.604 --> 23:32.644
The boy begins his journey somewhat faster.

23:32.644 --> 23:36.374
The girl, her heart hot and heavy,
also begins her journey.

23:36.674 --> 23:36.874
- Episode 8-
With the Princess
Beneath the Bright Blue Sky

23:36.874 --> 23:39.584
- Episode 8-
With the Princess
Beneath the Bright Blue Sky
What color shall the sky that envelops them be?

23:39.584 --> 23:40.134
- Episode 8-
With the Princess
Beneath the Bright Blue Sky
